QuestGuidance.Register("en",275,{
[8769]="7006D1CA\n1\tComplete Mission: In Need of Rescue\tYour mission is to rescue the prisoners being held in Eshadûr and save them from the Ordâkhai torturer Dokhára. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to get underway.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have freed the prisoners in Eshadûr and defeated Dokhára! Return with Khâdamul to report your success.\n",
[8770]="7005CAC8\n1\tComplete Mission: In the Trenches\tYour mission is to defend the Gate of Gath Uior from allies of the Iron Crown. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8771]="7005CAD1\n1\tSecure the Gate of Gath Uior\tSecure the Gate of Gath Uior.\n2\tRepair the broken barricades (total: 10)\tRepair the broken barricades.\n3\tReturn to the Elven defences\tReturn to the Elven defences.\n",
[8772]="70062FB3\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tFind your way to the scout\t\n",
[8773]="70063031\n1\tComplete the Mission: Infiltration\tSpeak with the mission giver and alert them that you are prepared to visit Herne at night to discuss the intent of the suspicious folk lurking about the town square.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tYou have discovered that there are nefarious elements mixing in with other refugees making their way to Herne. You must return to the mission giver and tell them of this development.\n",
[8774]="7005830D\n1\tCollect pure beryl in the Crystal Tunnels (total: 8)\tYou have been tasked with collecting pure beryl in the Crystal Tunnels beneath Skarháld.\n",
[8775]="7005830E\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Into the Crystal Tunnels'\tYou have been tasked with mining pure beryl from the Crystal Tunnels beneath Skarháld. You should talk to Hórin to travel to Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8776]="70062FB6\n1\tDefeat Gorgost\030Defeat Brogmarsh\030Defeat Rauzghuk\030Defeat wargs (total: 12)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8777]="7006302A\n1\tComplete the Mission: Into the Pits\tYou are asked to make your way into the hills to find three warg matrons who lead a pack of the vile beasts there. Speak with the mission giver in Lhan Garan to begin this mission.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tThe warg matrons were present in the pit and they were fearsome. You were victorious. Return to the mission giver in Lhan Garan and tell them of the success.\n",
[8778]="7005955D\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn outside the East-delf to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDefeat the half-orc overseer (total: 2)\030Destroy mining supplies (total: 10)\030Destroy mining carts (total: 10)\tYou should defeat half-orc overseers and destroy mining supplies and mining carts. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tReturn to the small cabin near the East-delf\tYou should return to the small cabin near the East-delf. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8779]="7005956B\n1\tComplete Mission: Invaders on the Delf\tYour mission is to defeat the half-orc forces gathered at the entrances to the mines of Writhenset. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8780]="700582DF\n1\tFind a way to seal the Redhorn Pass and stop the goblin invasion\tYou have been tasked with repelling the goblin invasion at Kidzul-kâlah and sealing the Redhorn Pass.\n",
[8781]="700582E2\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Invasion at the Redhorn Pass'\tYour mission is to repel the goblin invasion at Kidzul-kâlah and seal the Redhorn Pass. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8782]="70058720\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Jaws of the Dead'\tYour mission is to destroy collections of grisly trophies kept by the Wargs in Valdhellir. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Valdhellir.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8783]="70058723\n1\tDestroy collections of grisly trophies in Valdhellir (total: 10)\tYour mission is to destroy collections of grisly trophies kept by the Wargs in Valdhellir.\n",
[8784]="70062BEF\n1\tDefeat Jorthkyn in the ruins (total: 8)\030Defeat Wargs in the ruins ([see journal]/8)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8785]="70062CE1\n1\tComplete the Mission: Jorthkyn and Hounds\tAt ruins within Sedgemead there are Jorthkyn taking wargs as their servants. There is a growing fear that they will become another menace arrayed against the settlers in the region, and you are tasked with eliminating them.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tYou overcame the Jorthkyn attack at the ruins in Sedgemead and should now return to the mission giver and let them know of your efforts.\n",
[8786]="7005C0DC\n1\tRecover stolen treasures (total: 4)\tYou should defeat ice-giants and recover stolen treasures.\n2\tRegroup near the entrance to the chamber\tYou should regroup near the entrance to the cave.\n",
[8787]="7005C0DD\n1\tComplete Missions: Just Beyond Reach\tYour mission is to defeat ice-giants and recover stolen treasures. Speak to Hórin to travel to the ice-giant enclave.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8788]="70059855\n1\tDefeat servants of the Iron Crown at Rathad Caul (total: 10)\tYour mission is to defeat the Dourhand gate-keeper guarding Rathad Caul and tear down the banner of the Iron Crown.\n2\tSummon and defeat the Dourhand gate-keeper\tYour mission is to defeat the Dourhand gate-keeper guarding Rathad Caul and tear down the banner of the Iron Crown.\n3\tDestroy the banner of the Iron Crown\tYour mission is to defeat the Dourhand gate-keeper guarding Rathad Caul and tear down the banner of the Iron Crown.\n",
[8789]="7005985B\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Keepers of the Narrow Way'\tYour mission is to defeat the Dourhand gate-keeper guarding Rathad Caul and tear down the banner of the Iron Crown. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to Rathad Caul.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8790]="7006C509\n1\tComplete Mission: Kergrim on the Road\tYour mission is to travel to Tûkurdul and recover what you can from the ransacked shipment as well as save the driver from the kergrim. Speak with Raphûz to travel.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou have successfully recovered the ransacked supplies in Tûkurdul! Return with the scout to Raphûz with this report.\n",
[8791]="7006C129\n1\tComplete Mission: Kill It with Fire\tYour mission is to go to Dûlagig, seal the scorpion burrows with fire and cull their number. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have defeated the scorpions and destroyed their burrows. Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8792]="7005A816\n1\tDestroy stone-claw burrows (total: 12)\tYou should destroy stone-claw burrows.\n2\tDefeat Amshaz the Vast\tYou should defeat Amshaz the Vast.\n",
[8793]="7005A834\n1\tComplete Mission: King of Claws\tYour mission is to defeat Amshaz the Vast and destroy its burrow in Gundabad. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8794]="7006E4D4\n1\tComplete Mission: Lalia's Safe Passage\tAccording to Butterbur's tale, the barrow of the Last Prince lies between Northern Barrows and The Dead Spire, near a large standing stone. You have been asked to search the Barrow-downs for his missing daughter, who may have gone there in search of the fabled \"Last Prince.\"\n2\tTalk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony\tYou have delivered Lalia safely out of the Barrow-downs despite her efforts to walk unwittingly into every wight in the fog-drenched hills.\n",
[8795]="7005BE9A\n1\tComplete Mission: Lay to Rest\tYour mission is to destroy several corrupted sarcophagi and burn the corpses of the Angmarim scattered throughout. Speak to Hórin to travel to barrows.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8796]="7005BE9B\n1\tDestroy fell sarcophagi (total: 6)\030Burn the remains of fallen Angmarim (total: 10)\tYou should destroy fell sarcophagi and burn the remains of fallen Angmarim.\n2\tRegroup near the entrance to the cave\tYou should regroup near the entrance to the cave.\n",
[8797]="70062D10\n1\tComplete the Mission: Leadership Change\tOrdered by the taskmaster at Gramsfoot, you are to make your way to Hoarhallow and find a way to draw out the Mayor of the village and then put him to the sword.\n2\tReturn to Uglash at Gramsfoot\tYou drew the Mayor out of hiding. You also are pretty sure that you took him down. Best return to Uglash at Gramsfoot.\n",
[8798]="70062FB4\n1\tDefeat the injured White Hand war-leader\030Defeat melee Uruk-hai of the White Hand (total: 7)\030Defeat ranged White Hand Uruks (total: 7)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8799]="70063034\n1\tComplete the Mission: Leadership Direction\tAfter a failed raid on an encampment outside of Caras Gelebren, an Uruk leader was reportedly injured to point of near death. This development provides an opportunity for you to strike a vital blow.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tThe Uruk leader was not injured, he was more powerful than any of the other Uruks in the encampment. It appears that the information from the scouts was wrong or that there was something else at play with the war-leader.\n",
[8800]="7005955B\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the beginning of the tunnel to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tRetrieve stolen goods (total: 10)\030Unlock the first barricade\030Unlock the second barricade\030Unlock the third barricade\tYou should retrieve stolen supplies and find a way to unlock the barricades. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tDefeat the ruffian captain\tYou should defeat the ruffian captain. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
